# Normalize line endings to LF regardless of OS/core.autocrlf.
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) rewrite every text
# file to CRLF, which conflicts with Prettier's "lf" default and breaks
# `npm run lint` project-wide with thousands of whitespace-only errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
